# Source material: lecture PDFs, GoodNotes exports, archives. Kept out of git
# because it is large, binary, permanent once committed, and mostly other
# people's copyrighted slides. Notes written from it live in corpus/notes/.
# The directory's contents are ignored; the README explaining it is not, or
# the reasoning lives only on one machine.
sources/*
!sources/README.md
# Work in progress. Notes enter the repository when promoted, not before.
drafts/*
!drafts/README.md
*.zip
